# Per-run probe artifacts + full execution logs live under the session scratchpad
# (pass -e work_root=<scratchpad>/acceptance-runs). If the runner is invoked without
# that override it falls back to ./runs -- never commit those; only the mechanism is
# committed. The run receipt is written to <work_root>/receipts/LATEST.yml (codex-tick184);
# the tracked receipts/LATEST.yml is a historical record the runner no longer writes.
runs/
snap.tar
